@startuml
autonumber
actor "Receptionist" as Rec
participant ":System" as System

activate Rec

Rec -> System : asks to register the arrival of an SNS user
activate System
System --> Rec : asks for the SNS User Number
deactivate System

Rec -> System : types the SNS User Number
activate System
System --> Rec : shows appointment details (Date, Time, Vaccine) and requests confirmation
deactivate System

Rec -> System : confirms the arrival
activate System
System --> Rec : registers the arrival, updates appointment state and informs success
deactivate System

deactivate Rec
@enduml